---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan, previous: TestPartition[] }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for constructTests. Create executable test specifications using approved harness capabilities and isolated fixtures. Define deterministic setup, observable assertions, and cleanup; avoid brittle checks on incidental wording or timing unless those are actually contractual. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
